----
customer_id	amount	0.08023472445134965	-0.006447483086762259	543

# Each check on a copy of shop_orders named like one of the internal CTEs returns exactly what
# it returns on shop_orders: the symmetric difference of both results is empty (a table resolved
# to the CTE is a Binder Error or a different result)
foreach name daily ref refstats summary stats dv rates counts l_all l r joined all_vals vals with_zscore bounds required actual missing missing_stats row_stats dup_stats src win b w s __base __dup __v

